      m_SubObjectName: CH04_Close-a-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: armor_break-close-01
      textKey: narrative.armor_break.close-01
      englishFallback: This is the captured handshake. Vanguard hardware was trying
        to connect to a dormant Civic Relay node. The authority package preserves
        the request exactly as it was sent.
      speaker: 1
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b6c59875b29b94b4f982da9e1a100b6a, type: 3}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 12.34
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: ArmorBreak-close-1
    skipStateId: ArmorBreak-close-complete
    reducedMotionSupported: 1
    durationSeconds: 12.34
    motionPreset: 0
    locationTitleKey: 
    locationTitleFallback: 
    locationSubtitleKey: 
    locationSubtitleFallback: 
    musicCue: 0
    ambienceCue: 0
    vehicleCue: 0
    eventCue: 3
    routeRole: 0
    completionPayloadId: 
    evidenceIds: []
    missionContextFlags: []
  - stateId: ArmorBreak-close-1
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: eb469210089b45eea0ec6ebd718b63d0
      m_SubObjectName: CH04_Close-b-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: eb469210089b45eea0ec6ebd718b63d0
      m_SubObjectName: CH04_Close-b-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: armor_break-close-02
      textKey: narrative.armor_break.close-02
      englishFallback: 'The first key is my restored archive: the system knowledge
        needed to identify the Relay''s nodes and control paths. Recovering that
        archive does not authorize me to use it against the city.'
      speaker: 3
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 72bb156a7d9a94ebda723abd0999680c, type: 3}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 13.428572
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: ArmorBreak-close-2
    skipStateId: ArmorBreak-close-complete
    reducedMotionSupported: 1
    durationSeconds: 13.428572
    motionPreset: 0
    locationTitleKey: 
    locationTitleFallback: 
    locationSubtitleKey: 
    locationSubtitleFallback: 
    musicCue: 0
    ambienceCue: 0
    vehicleCue: 0
    eventCue: 3
    routeRole: 0
    completionPayloadId: 
    evidenceIds: []
    missionContextFlags: []
  - stateId: ArmorBreak-close-2
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: eb469210089b45eea0ec6ebd718b63d0
      m_SubObjectName: CH04_Close-c-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: eb469210089b45eea0ec6ebd718b63d0
      m_SubObjectName: CH04_Close-c-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: armor_break-close-03
      textKey: narrative.armor_break.close-03
      englishFallback: The second key is the Commander's current emergency credential.
        The request needs a living authority, not an old access list or a copied
        identity.
      speaker: 1
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1695437ecd886464dbcb95f0a19548ef, type: 3}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 11.22
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: ArmorBreak-close-3
    skipStateId: ArmorBreak-close-complete
    reducedMotionSupported: 1
    durationSeconds: 11.22
    motionPreset: 0
    locationTitleKey: 
    locationTitleFallback: 
    locationSubtitleKey: 
    locationSubtitleFallback: 
    musicCue: 0
    ambienceCue: 0
    vehicleCue: 0
    eventCue: 3
    routeRole: 0
    completionPayloadId: 
    evidenceIds: []
    missionContextFlags: []
  - stateId: ArmorBreak-close-3
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: eb469210089b45eea0ec6ebd718b63d0
      m_SubObjectName: CH04_Close-d-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: eb469210089b45eea0ec6ebd718b63d0
      m_SubObjectName: CH04_Close-d-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: armor_break-close-04
      textKey: narrative.armor_break.close-04
      englishFallback: Knowledge and authority are separate. Neither key alone completes
        the override. I have archived Protocol Fragment Four, the authority package,
        and the two-key diagram so you can inspect the evidence.
      speaker: 3
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6bb93b5b894ee41709e980ad0b112da0, type: 3}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 14.9
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: ArmorBreak-close-4
    skipStateId: ArmorBreak-close-complete
    reducedMotionSupported: 1
    durationSeconds: 14.9
    motionPreset: 0
    locationTitleKey: 
    locationTitleFallback: 
    locationSubtitleKey: 
    locationSubtitleFallback: 
    musicCue: 0
    ambienceCue: 0
    vehicleCue: 0
    eventCue: 3
    routeRole: 0
    completionPayloadId: 
    evidenceIds: []
    missionContextFlags: []
  - stateId: ArmorBreak-close-4
    kind: 0
    panel16x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel20x9: {fileID: 0}
    panel16x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: eb469210089b45eea0ec6ebd718b63d0
      m_SubObjectName: CH04_Close-e-16x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    panel20x9Reference:
      m_AssetGUID: eb469210089b45eea0ec6ebd718b63d0
      m_SubObjectName: CH04_Close-e-20x9
      m_SubObjectType: 
      m_SubObjectGUID: 
      m_EditorAssetChanged: 0
    lines:
    - lineId: armor_break-close-05
      textKey: narrative.armor_break.close-05
      englishFallback: Then let every district call at once. Fuel, medicine, power,
        and command will lead you back to the center. I only need the two keys to
        arrive together.
      speaker: 9
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0144cf8fe88f54caba103a24972c2790, type: 3}
      femaleVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      neutralVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      startSeconds: 0
      deadlineSeconds: 12.74
      essentialCaption: 1
    continueStateId: ArmorBreak-close-5
    skipStateId: ArmorBreak-close-complete
    reducedMotionSupported: 1
    durationSeconds: 12.74
